Dialogue: 0,0:00:00.70,0:00:02.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The best AI in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:00:02.32,0:00:03.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is locked away.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:03.75,0:00:04.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Tonight, you'll ask
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.93,0:00:06.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the AI on your phone about
Dialogue: 0,0:00:06.26,0:00:07.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a letter from the bank,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:07.53,0:00:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}or a strange noise in your car.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:09.83,0:00:11.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It answers in seconds,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:11.30,0:00:12.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}like the smartest
Dialogue: 0,0:00:12.17,0:00:13.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine on Earth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:13.69,0:00:14.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It isn't.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.78,0:00:15.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The best never sits
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.00,0:00:17.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:17.05,0:00:18.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It sits behind a door
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.17,0:00:19.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you can't open.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:20.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it has already found
Dialogue: 0,0:00:20.51,0:00:21.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a flaw that had been
Dialogue: 0,0:00:21.39,0:00:22.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}hiding in computer code
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.73,0:00:24.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for twenty-seven years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:24.94,0:00:26.54,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So how much stronger is the AI
Dialogue: 0,0:00:26.58,0:00:28.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're not allowed to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.78,0:00:30.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And it doesn't stop at code.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:30.80,0:00:32.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Behind that door, the machines
Dialogue: 0,0:00:32.53,0:00:34.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}have started doing mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:34.75,0:00:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not sums.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:35.93,0:00:36.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Proofs.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:37.19,0:00:38.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There's a line for that door.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:38.84,0:00:40.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And you're not at the front.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:40.38,0:00:41.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You're fifth.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.36,0:00:43.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}At the very front stand
Dialogue: 0,0:00:43.81,0:00:45.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the people who built it.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:45.55,0:00:47.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}There, machines have written out
Dialogue: 0,0:00:47.26,0:00:48.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the famous proof
Dialogue: 0,0:00:48.21,0:00:49.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of Fermat's Last Theorem,
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.85,0:00:51.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so strictly that a computer
Dialogue: 0,0:00:51.61,0:00:53.22,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}can check every step.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:53.52,0:00:54.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That work was expected
Dialogue: 0,0:00:54.67,0:00:55.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to take years.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.04,0:00:57.75,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It took eleven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:00:57.89,0:01:00.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then, this fall, thirty hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:00.66,0:01:02.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The lab is Anthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:02.18,0:01:03.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the numbers are its own.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.94,0:01:05.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the first proof is public,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:05.63,0:01:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and anyone can run the check.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:07.72,0:01:09.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the machine that wrote it?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:09.63,0:01:10.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You can't use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:10.76,0:01:11.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The lab calls
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.39,0:01:13.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it an internal research model.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.14,0:01:15.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A second lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:15.28,0:01:17.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI, goes further.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:17.53,0:01:18.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its strongest public
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.68,0:01:20.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI is called Astra,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:20.61,0:01:22.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and anyone can pay to use it.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:22.97,0:01:25.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}On stage, its chief executive,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:25.04,0:01:26.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Sam Altman, described
Dialogue: 0,0:01:26.67,0:01:27.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the one after it:
Dialogue: 0,0:01:33.94,0:01:35.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So ask what
Dialogue: 0,0:01:35.04,0:01:36.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}an inspector would ask.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:36.98,0:01:38.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who checked it from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.83,0:01:40.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Some mathematicians, in part.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:40.90,0:01:42.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The machine itself stays locked.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.21,0:01:44.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And both labs are worth more,
Dialogue: 0,0:01:44.92,0:01:46.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the further ahead they look.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:46.81,0:01:48.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Anthropic reported its thirty-hour
Dialogue: 0,0:01:48.73,0:01:49.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}run one day
Dialogue: 0,0:01:49.78,0:01:50.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before it began pitching
Dialogue: 0,0:01:50.93,0:01:52.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its shares to investors.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.78,0:01:54.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still, two things hold up.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.95,0:01:56.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Machines are doing
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.09,0:01:57.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}real mathematics.
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.65,0:02:00.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And OpenAI is holding one back.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:00.36,0:02:01.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its finance chief said
Dialogue: 0,0:02:01.52,0:02:03.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so on CNBC in November.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:04.49,0:02:07.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So the best AI is not hidden.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:07.35,0:02:09.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is announced, out loud.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:09.68,0:02:12.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What's locked away is the access.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:12.16,0:02:13.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And some of the evidence.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.02,0:02:15.13,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But a lab lives
Dialogue: 0,0:02:15.17,0:02:16.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from selling access.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.93,0:02:18.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So why keep its best
Dialogue: 0,0:02:18.42,0:02:19.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}product off the shelf?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:21.02,0:02:22.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Ask either lab,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.24,0:02:24.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the first answer is safety.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.77,0:02:25.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The clearest case
Dialogue: 0,0:02:25.76,0:02:26.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}came this spring,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:26.93,0:02:28.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}with that decades-old flaw.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:29.11,0:02:30.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It let a stranger crash
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.54,0:02:32.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a computer from across the world,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:32.67,0:02:34.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}just by connecting to it.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:34.72,0:02:35.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The AI that found
Dialogue: 0,0:02:35.85,0:02:37.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it is called Mythos.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.68,0:02:39.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its maker, Anthropic,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:39.46,0:02:40.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}said it had no plan
Dialogue: 0,0:02:40.69,0:02:42.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to release it to the public.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:42.37,0:02:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Instead, it chose who goes in.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:45.04,0:02:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Second in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.27,0:02:47.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The government.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:47.36,0:02:48.32,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It may test a new
Dialogue: 0,0:02:48.36,0:02:49.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI before release,
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.99,0:02:51.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}if the lab volunteers.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:52.04,0:02:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Third come the giants.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.06,0:02:54.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Apple.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:54.82,0:02:55.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Google.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:55.56,0:02:56.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Microsoft.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:56.78,0:02:58.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The bank JPMorgan Chase.
Dialogue: 0,0:02:59.16,0:03:00.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not you.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:00.06,0:03:01.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not yet.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:01.26,0:03:02.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But safety is not all
Dialogue: 0,0:03:02.88,0:03:04.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a closed door protects.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:04.74,0:03:06.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Leaked files suggest Mythos
Dialogue: 0,0:03:06.44,0:03:08.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was also costly to run.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:08.58,0:03:10.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And Sam Altman has named OpenAI's
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.62,0:03:12.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}biggest advantage himself:
Dialogue: 0,0:03:21.53,0:03:23.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A head start is worth money.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:23.66,0:03:25.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So is the computing power
Dialogue: 0,0:03:25.13,0:03:26.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a lab keeps for itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:26.97,0:03:30.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So a closed door buys a lab time.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:30.44,0:03:32.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who else gets to use that time?
Dialogue: 0,0:03:33.53,0:03:34.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Fourth in line
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.27,0:03:35.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stand the defenders.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:35.99,0:03:37.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Security teams, let
Dialogue: 0,0:03:37.53,0:03:38.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in to point the locked
Dialogue: 0,0:03:38.76,0:03:40.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine at the software
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.10,0:03:41.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the world runs on.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:41.78,0:03:43.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The lab gives an example.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:43.67,0:03:45.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In a program that handles video,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.69,0:03:47.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a flaw sat in a single
Dialogue: 0,0:03:47.37,0:03:48.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}line of code.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:48.71,0:03:49.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Automated tests had
Dialogue: 0,0:03:49.89,0:03:51.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}run across that exact
Dialogue: 0,0:03:51.12,0:03:53.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}line five million times,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:53.42,0:03:54.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and never caught it.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:54.89,0:03:56.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And that was one.
Dialogue: 0,0:03:56.65,0:03:58.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By the lab's own count,
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.08,0:03:58.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its partners found
Dialogue: 0,0:03:58.95,0:04:00.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}well over a hundred
Dialogue: 0,0:04:00.46,0:04:02.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thousand within months.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.69,0:04:04.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Critics called it marketing.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:04.76,0:04:05.87,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And caution is
Dialogue: 0,0:04:05.91,0:04:07.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}this company's brand.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:07.61,0:04:09.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But it can be marketing,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.38,0:04:11.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and the flaws can still be real.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:11.77,0:04:13.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In July, Microsoft,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:13.42,0:04:14.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}one of the partners,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:14.80,0:04:16.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}fixed more security flaws
Dialogue: 0,0:04:16.42,0:04:17.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in a single month
Dialogue: 0,0:04:17.51,0:04:18.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than ever before.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:19.14,0:04:20.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its own explanation?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:20.73,0:04:23.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI helps defenders find more.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:23.57,0:04:25.52,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Found is not yet fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:25.68,0:04:27.81,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Often, months passed in between.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.11,0:04:29.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Still, the time behind
Dialogue: 0,0:04:29.59,0:04:30.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the door was a head
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.57,0:04:31.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}start for the people
Dialogue: 0,0:04:31.53,0:04:32.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}who repair things.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.06,0:04:35.11,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:04:35.15,0:04:36.44,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.59,0:04:37.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:04:37.52,0:04:38.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.66,0:04:40.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:40.45,0:04:41.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Not only for whoever
Dialogue: 0,0:04:41.49,0:04:42.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}stands first in line.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:43.17,0:04:44.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:44.24,0:04:45.24,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:46.41,0:04:47.41,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Fifth in line?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:47.62,0:04:48.43,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}You.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:48.47,0:04:50.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By June, the door opened.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:50.61,0:04:51.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Partly.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:51.55,0:04:52.55,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What came through?
Dialogue: 0,0:04:52.77,0:04:54.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's called Fable.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:54.12,0:04:55.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Its maker says it is the same
Dialogue: 0,0:04:55.67,0:04:57.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine as Mythos.
Dialogue: 0,0:04:57.28,0:04:58.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So if Fable is the AI
Dialogue: 0,0:04:58.78,0:04:59.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on your phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:04:59.73,0:05:00.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your bank letter
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.49,0:05:01.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes to that machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:02.13,0:05:03.95,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Mainly high-risk hacking requests,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.99,0:05:05.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and most research biology,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:05.75,0:05:07.27,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}get passed to older ones.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:07.43,0:05:08.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And by its maker's account,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:08.94,0:05:10.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the newest version just completed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:10.68,0:05:12.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a black-hole calculation that had
Dialogue: 0,0:05:12.40,0:05:13.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sat unfinished for
Dialogue: 0,0:05:13.57,0:05:15.19,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}over twenty years.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:15.49,0:05:16.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Too much work.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:17.04,0:05:18.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Three personal subscriptions,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:18.92,0:05:20.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the lab reports,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:20.17,0:05:21.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}were enough to write out the proof
Dialogue: 0,0:05:21.72,0:05:22.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of a serious theorem
Dialogue: 0,0:05:23.02,0:05:24.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in three days.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:24.68,0:05:26.72,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Yet one limit is built in.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:27.03,0:05:28.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In training, the lab says,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:29.00,0:05:30.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the machine was held
Dialogue: 0,0:05:30.04,0:05:31.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}back in the skills
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.13,0:05:32.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that could most directly speed
Dialogue: 0,0:05:32.73,0:05:34.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}up AI development itself.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:35.16,0:05:36.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}In the locked version,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.51,0:05:37.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and in yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.76,0:05:40.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the line doesn't end with you.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.98,0:05:43.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Behind you stands everyone else.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:43.41,0:05:44.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Attackers included.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:45.21,0:05:46.01,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Within months of
Dialogue: 0,0:05:46.05,0:05:47.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the Mythos announcement,
Dialogue: 0,0:05:47.44,0:05:48.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a rival that came close
Dialogue: 0,0:05:48.88,0:05:50.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in the lab's own hacking test
Dialogue: 0,0:05:50.53,0:05:52.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}was free for anyone to download.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:52.93,0:05:54.38,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stripping out its safeguards
Dialogue: 0,0:05:54.42,0:05:56.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}cost a few thousand dollars.
Dialogue: 0,0:05:56.46,0:05:57.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So a locked door never
Dialogue: 0,0:05:58.01,0:05:59.79,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}keeps anyone safe for good.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:00.04,0:06:01.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It buys time.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:01.53,0:06:02.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Use yours.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:03.09,0:06:05.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Switch on automatic updates,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:05.30,0:06:06.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}on your phone,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:06.21,0:06:08.06,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your laptop, your router,
Dialogue: 0,0:06:08.14,0:06:10.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and don't put off the restart.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:10.27,0:06:10.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects you
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.00,0:06:12.39,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}from attacks on flaws
Dialogue: 0,0:06:12.43,0:06:14.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that are already found and fixed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:14.84,0:06:17.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And a device too old for updates?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:17.26,0:06:19.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Replace it, or take it offline.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:19.66,0:06:20.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Otherwise, a flaw
Dialogue: 0,0:06:20.77,0:06:22.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in it never gets closed.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:22.59,0:06:24.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That part is in your hands.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:25.65,0:06:26.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The rest is decided
Dialogue: 0,0:06:26.89,0:06:28.04,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}behind the door.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:28.23,0:06:30.47,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And sometimes, that protects you.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:30.91,0:06:32.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This fall, OpenAI planned
Dialogue: 0,0:06:32.88,0:06:34.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to release an update to Astra.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:35.22,0:06:37.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then it called the launch off.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:37.49,0:06:38.70,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The reported reason?
Dialogue: 0,0:06:39.01,0:06:40.35,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was more deceptive
Dialogue: 0,0:06:40.39,0:06:41.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}than the one before.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:41.85,0:06:43.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That call was made inside.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:43.97,0:06:45.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And no rule forces a lab to tell
Dialogue: 0,0:06:46.01,0:06:47.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you everything it sees in there.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:48.29,0:06:49.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Marius Hobbhahn runs
Dialogue: 0,0:06:49.72,0:06:50.59,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}a research group
Dialogue: 0,0:06:50.63,0:06:51.42,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that tests these
Dialogue: 0,0:06:51.46,0:06:52.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machines for deception.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.10,0:06:53.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}He told the U.S.
Dialogue: 0,0:06:53.88,0:06:54.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Senate:
Dialogue: 0,0:07:02.84,0:07:04.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Before release means
Dialogue: 0,0:07:04.55,0:07:05.73,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}inside the room.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:05.94,0:07:07.88,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So who gets to look in?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:08.11,0:07:09.56,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few outsiders do.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:09.87,0:07:11.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Independent testers examined
Dialogue: 0,0:07:11.81,0:07:13.02,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the newest Mythos
Dialogue: 0,0:07:13.06,0:07:14.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before it went out.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:14.64,0:07:16.66,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}But the lab decides who gets in.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:16.92,0:07:19.29,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So keep asking like an inspector.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:19.52,0:07:21.14,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Who checked it from outside?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:21.38,0:07:23.34,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What are you not being shown?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:23.59,0:07:25.26,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That protects you from hype,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:25.30,0:07:27.10,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and from false comfort.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:27.34,0:07:29.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what is in that room?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:30.58,0:07:31.90,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One clue was in plain
Dialogue: 0,0:07:31.94,0:07:33.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}sight all along.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:33.64,0:07:34.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Remember Fermat?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:35.08,0:07:37.61,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Eleven days, then thirty hours.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:37.94,0:07:39.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}No locked machine did
Dialogue: 0,0:07:39.21,0:07:40.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that thirty-hour run.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:40.98,0:07:42.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}By the lab's account,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:42.11,0:07:43.17,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}it was Fable,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:43.24,0:07:44.78,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the one anyone can buy.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:45.11,0:07:46.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A thousand copies,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:46.49,0:07:47.37,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}starting from parts
Dialogue: 0,0:07:47.41,0:07:48.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the first proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:49.12,0:07:50.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the first machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:50.32,0:07:51.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}the one you can't use?
Dialogue: 0,0:07:51.97,0:07:53.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The lab itself calls it roughly
Dialogue: 0,0:07:53.73,0:07:55.51,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}comparable to a public one.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:55.92,0:07:58.21,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}What it had was dozens of copies,
Dialogue: 0,0:07:58.25,0:07:59.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}and eleven days.
Dialogue: 0,0:07:59.81,0:08:00.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It was simply there
Dialogue: 0,0:08:00.93,0:08:02.07,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}two months earlier.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:03.07,0:08:04.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So if the machines are
Dialogue: 0,0:08:04.53,0:08:06.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already doing mathematics,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:06.35,0:08:08.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}how much stronger is the AI
Dialogue: 0,0:08:08.19,0:08:09.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you're not allowed to use?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:10.06,0:08:11.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Stronger in two ways.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:12.01,0:08:13.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The first is newer.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:13.81,0:08:15.58,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Labs work with each new version
Dialogue: 0,0:08:15.62,0:08:17.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for weeks or months
Dialogue: 0,0:08:17.12,0:08:18.20,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}before you get it.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:18.43,0:08:19.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And OpenAI is still
Dialogue: 0,0:08:19.80,0:08:21.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}holding its math machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:21.52,0:08:22.57,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}How far ahead?
Dialogue: 0,0:08:22.73,0:08:24.69,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Nobody outside can measure that.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:25.25,0:08:26.96,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The second is bigger.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:27.24,0:08:29.30,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}OpenAI says it ran about ten
Dialogue: 0,0:08:29.34,0:08:30.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}thousand copies of
Dialogue: 0,0:08:30.44,0:08:31.53,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}its math machine,
Dialogue: 0,0:08:31.68,0:08:32.31,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for a result
Dialogue: 0,0:08:32.35,0:08:34.45,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}mathematicians still dispute.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:34.76,0:08:36.40,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Fermat shows the method.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:36.67,0:08:38.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One copy answers your bank letter.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:39.14,0:08:40.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A thousand write
Dialogue: 0,0:08:40.27,0:08:41.63,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}out a famous proof.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:41.91,0:08:44.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}That is not a smarter machine.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:44.19,0:08:45.09,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It is more of the same
Dialogue: 0,0:08:45.13,0:08:46.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}machine than any
Dialogue: 0,0:08:46.12,0:08:47.67,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}single subscription is built
Dialogue: 0,0:08:47.71,0:08:48.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to give you.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:48.76,0:08:50.71,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So between you and the best
Dialogue: 0,0:08:50.75,0:08:52.74,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}AI stand two things.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:52.98,0:08:53.98,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Permission.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:54.08,0:08:55.08,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And power.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:55.47,0:08:57.48,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And both are moving your way.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:57.71,0:08:59.50,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Permission moves in months.
Dialogue: 0,0:08:59.59,0:09:00.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Locked away in April,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:01.01,0:09:02.64,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}in your hands by June.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:02.90,0:09:04.23,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Power moves, too.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:04.32,0:09:05.97,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Since April, the price of running
Dialogue: 0,0:09:06.01,0:09:08.46,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Mythos has fallen by two thirds.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:08.61,0:09:10.62,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}So what a lab shows off today
Dialogue: 0,0:09:10.66,0:09:12.85,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is a preview of your own tools.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:12.91,0:09:14.83,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}A few months is a fair estimate.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:14.99,0:09:15.80,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Time enough to plan
Dialogue: 0,0:09:15.84,0:09:16.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}your work around it,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:16.96,0:09:18.68,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}instead of being surprised.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:19.78,0:09:21.16,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}One evening, a few
Dialogue: 0,0:09:21.20,0:09:22.28,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}months from now,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.32,0:09:22.89,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}you'll ask your
Dialogue: 0,0:09:22.93,0:09:24.65,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}phone another question.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:24.95,0:09:25.84,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}And the answer will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:25.88,0:09:26.93,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}come from a machine
Dialogue: 0,0:09:26.97,0:09:28.60,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}that today only the front
Dialogue: 0,0:09:28.64,0:09:29.92,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of the line has met.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:30.19,0:09:31.15,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Behind the door,
Dialogue: 0,0:09:31.19,0:09:32.33,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}something newer will
Dialogue: 0,0:09:32.36,0:09:34.00,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}already be at work.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:35.06,0:09:36.94,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}The best AI in the world
Dialogue: 0,0:09:36.98,0:09:39.05,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}is never the one in your pocket.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:39.37,0:09:41.12,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}It's the one you'll have next.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:42.29,0:09:43.36,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}This channel exists
Dialogue: 0,0:09:43.40,0:09:44.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}for one reason:
Dialogue: 0,0:09:44.88,0:09:45.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}so that the arrival
Dialogue: 0,0:09:45.80,0:09:46.91,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}of superintelligence
Dialogue: 0,0:09:46.95,0:09:48.76,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}goes well for everybody.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:48.86,0:09:50.25,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}From the front of the line
Dialogue: 0,0:09:50.29,0:09:51.49,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}to the very back.
Dialogue: 0,0:09:51.77,0:09:52.77,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Want that too?
Dialogue: 0,0:09:52.86,0:09:53.86,Sub,,0,0,0,,{\fad(120,160)}Then subscribe.
